{
  "_doc": "Option sets a question can be resolved to when it arrives without criteria (serve/jev_server.py, resolve_presets). 'about' is the option text the router reads, so it describes the QUESTION, not the labels. 'multiple' is the default when the router's own single/multiple reading is close to 0.5.",
